==Strategy==
This stage can easily be rushed with [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|Anti-Dark]]/[[:Category:Behemoth Slayer Cats|Behemoth Slayer]] Cats since Darkjo is not treated as a boss unit, and can therefore be knocked back behind the enemy base. Units like a talented [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] or [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]] can help in the beginning to keep the enemies from advancing too much, as well as gaining [[Extra Money]] from them, and units like [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] and [[Ancient Egg: N103 (Rare Cat)|Gas Mask Cat]] can be used to push Darkjo behind the base, while [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] and [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Teacher BearCat]] can help with the Li'l Bun Buns and Wild Doges respectively if they push through your frontline. Any Research [[Cat Combo]]s will be a great help as they will allow you to quickly stack your units and destroy the base far before the second Darkjo spawns.

